WEBVTT

00:01.853 --> 00:01.913
you

00:43.210 --> 00:47.091
We took the pieces from the fire

00:50.452 --> 00:54.013
We pulled the diamonds from the wire

00:57.743 --> 01:03.328
There was a time we had a name Before the fracture

01:03.548 --> 01:08.272
and the flame Now all the colours bleed to white

01:08.632 --> 01:15.758
Beneath this artificial light We are the

01:15.778 --> 01:19.141
fractured prisons In the cold

01:21.692 --> 01:27.680
We bend the light from stories we were told.

01:28.922 --> 01:36.482
I shower glass to catch the morning sun. Look at

01:36.522 --> 01:43.564
the beautiful damage we have done

01:44.104 --> 01:48.645
They built a wall to keep us in They try to wash

01:48.665 --> 01:54.486
away the sin Boo, every crack inside the stone is

01:54.606 --> 01:59.608
just a path that we have known We hold the edges

01:59.748 --> 02:04.129
sharp and clear There is no room for pity

02:08.230 --> 02:12.931
We bend the light! We bend the light!

02:36.522 --> 02:42.927
We ban the lights!

02:43.607 --> 02:44.688
We ban the lights!

03:04.831 --> 03:12.053
We are fractured prisms freezing cold We bend

03:12.073 --> 03:18.755
the light from stories we were told

03:18.855 --> 03:26.217
Let's share a glass to catch the morning sun Look

03:26.317 --> 03:30.659
at the beautiful damage we have done

03:37.016 --> 03:39.705
The Fractured Precepts

